t problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Hypothetical fix for https://github.com/GDQuest/zed-gdscript/issues/69 (Zed behaves differently for symlinks on Linux, so will need testing from the reporter on Windows)\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nTill now we did transform incoming paths to account for symlinks. However we did not transform the paths we returned to the client to match the location at which the client is opened. This PR fixes that.\r\n\r\nThe diff looks worse than it is, since I moved functions between classes. (For convenient client access. I'm planning to move all LSP functions into `GDScriptLanguageProtocol` in the future.)\r\n\r\n> [!NOTE]\r\n> \r\n> **LLM Disclosure**: Copilot was used to rewrite the calls to the moved functions, since no programmatic re-factoring functionally could cover that.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/